  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving public health by solar-powered water sanitation systems in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By utilizing the potentials of the water-energy nexus UNIDO aims to set up a solar-powered slow filtration system to produce clean water adopting Japanese innovative technologies in an Ethiopian rural area. The proposed project will focus on improving the host communities# public health and freeing women and children from water drawing labor in the host community.</narrative>
  </description>
